{"games":[{"id":125605938766538,"name":"World War 3","desc":"The world is in chaos—and only one nation can rise to power. In World War 3, build your army, conquer territories, and clash with other players in a full-scale global war. Buy troops, declare war, and dominate the battlefield in this action-packed strategy game.\n\n💰 Collect Cash\n🏝️ Invade Lands\n🔧 Upgrade Your Forces\n🌍  Expand Your Nation!\n\n👍 Like & Favorite for more updates!","path":"/game/125605938766538-world-war-3","slug":"125605938766538-world-war-3","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/20cda1eda65763ad1431b64396345c3265feb5b0665af05141f3d19cd0e2598d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2a090d3c60165ed9c46f4ceae501d80b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":27403878,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-06T20:12:04.818Z","creator":{"name":"WW3 io","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":86850584748471,"name":"[☢️] Steal a Ride","desc":"🗣️ Welcome to Steal a Ride!\n\n👍 Like the game and join the group\n👍NEW CODE! 50KLIKES\n\nHow to Play:\n🚗 Buy cars\n🕵️‍♂️ Steal cars from other players\n💸 Generate money\n📈 Rebirth and increase your income\n👊 Use gear and slaps to troll other players!\n\n💻 Supports Desktop, Mobile, Tablet, and Console players!","path":"/game/86850584748471-steal-a-ride","slug":"86850584748471-steal-a-ride","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1d29c57cb74e41433746229ff089bf3db342b2da59ae60e0e5ec35d6b7c91919.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f004916b87f40ef69e5feaeee9290228/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":67775790,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-16T08:18:19.577Z","creator":{"name":"Swipe Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":138021744389573,"name":"DA MISERY OBBY","desc":"🌟 **MISS DA KIND OF MISERY** 🌟\n\nWelcome to **DA MISERY OBBY** — an obstacle course built to test your skills, patience, and determination! 💀🔥\n\nJump, climb, dodge, and conquer your way through challenging stages packed with obstacles, surprises, and motivational messages. Whether you're a beginner or an obby pro, every checkpoint is a reminder that **progress matters more than perfection.** 💪\n\n✨ **FEATURES:**\n🏃 Fun & challenging obstacle courses\n💾 Checkpoints to save your progress\n📈 Increasing difficulty as you advance\n🏆 Bragging rights if you reach the end\n\n🎮 **Think you can survive DA MISERY?** Make it through every stage and prove that you don't need to be perfect — you just need to keep going. 🔥\n\n👍 **Like & ⭐ Favorite** the game if you enjoyed it!\n👥 **Invite your friends** and race them to the finish!\n\n#Roblox #RobloxObby #Obby #RobloxGames #RobloxCommunity #RobloxChallenge #ObbyChallenge #Parkour #RobloxFun #DaMisery #MissDaKindOfMisery","path":"/game/138021744389573-da-misery-obby","slug":"138021744389573-da-misery-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4357326bb0a93d588ac12dd4c54938f3f3b9651f9e6e4d3d07ced086df4baceb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ab7dcd07864e13bb1f45b76e2f312e9a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":1563803,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T01:33:00.004Z","creator":{"name":"ProtoStudio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":126418248369553,"name":"+1 Jump Mace Escape","desc":"🔨 Welcome to +1 Jump Mace Escape! 🔨\n\n⚡ Every step = +1 Jump Mace Power\n💪 Train your Mace and jump farther\n\n👍 Like the game and join the group\n🔔Turn on notifications for future updates\n","path":"/game/126418248369553-1-jump-mace-escape","slug":"126418248369553-1-jump-mace-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ccc73ae154561596a45d277821645637a25b6074834618d41e35a68684170a73.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0c4d987207cc3141b276948afe6ac545/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":9928472,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:05.672Z","creator":{"name":"miner x aren","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":115647903237640,"name":"One Fighting Spirit 4","desc":"👹 Verison \"4\" --- Choose between Famous Characters -- with SSS-Tier skills 👺\n\nBecome the strongest Fighting Spirit! Win every battle you choose, grow stronger with each victory, and use your rewards to buy health and characters.\n\n👍 Like the game to support future updates!\n\n“Prayer in Islam, along with healthy eating and daily exercise, brings deep and lasting happiness in this life. And when death comes, it leads to Paradise.\nAbandoning prayer and following desires, however, brings profound misery in this world, and upon death leads to Hell — a wretched destiny.\nBoth paths have been tried in this life: happiness was found in the first, and sorrow in the second.”","path":"/game/115647903237640-one-fighting-spirit-4","slug":"115647903237640-one-fighting-spirit-4","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/19182c9cc0785e74ac49a62fe87a275f348e0175e46d7dc568f08326a40ecf9c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b0d6f4c1b0f5c037585d19f6343afe32/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":9797612,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-24T06:30:09.151Z","creator":{"name":"Servants of Allah: Islam Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":139599445793213,"name":"Watermelon Merge Simulator!  [Suika]","desc":"👍 Thumbs up to help support the game!\n\n🔊 Completely original soundtrack thanks to ImprintzXD!\n\n🍉Inspired by the physics based puzzle game Suika but very early in development. \n\nAlso includes a 3D mode which is basically an entirely different game with different strategies.\n\nMouse click or tap the screen to place a fruit, it will drop where your mouse/finger is.  If a fruit reaches the red you'll lose.  Press the \"Hold\" button to switch your currently dropping fruit and next fruit up!  If you're on keyboard you can