ile Button\nCrouching LeftCTRL/L3/Mobile Button\nFlashlight - F/Up DPad/Mobile Button\n\nAll Rights go to Valve and their Game. Inspired by L4D (maybe)","path":"/game/15000290344-l4b","slug":"15000290344-l4b","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/229ad75cc8f951233df4d3135d32a2e08dd5cbf8ce979e57dc33898ed3163e38.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5873e9d21fcdc31ffc634003c24da8c1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":3260246,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-24T09:28:22.884Z","creator":{"name":"zCuteFoxy","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17762452689,"name":"3D Planets Simulator [BETA]","desc":"Welcome to 3D Planets Simulator! In this game, you can build a rocket, set up a base, and survive Earth’s death (or not). Alternatively, you can survive a gazillion bugs!!!\n\nNo, we're not copying other similar planet games, as we are all fangames of Untitled Planet Game (a sadly deleted and discontinued game). Objects like Humanciperson were given permission by the creator to use in 3PS.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nTry out some of these features in-game:\nColonize your favorite planets! 🪐\nTerraform hundreds of objects! 🌳\nIndustrialize and create giant money-making machines! 💵\nMake your own custom ships that you can save and load anywhere you want! 🚀*\nExplore over 30 unique systems! ⭐\nInteract with aliens! 👽\n\n* Requires save staff, acquired via gamepass or badge.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nInspired by Untitled Planet Game and Solar System Exploration 2.\n\nCredits found on the main menu.","path":"/game/17762452689-3d-planets-simulator","slug":"17762452689-3d-planets-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/18cd2cfb4caa245ae879125b4b3d300f42cd8d80712e0543a331d0efc7076788.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-52f2d6c976ab890c9d499ecf4df82364/150/150/Image/Png/noFilte